       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. REFMODDEMO.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 FULL-STR PIC X(10) VALUE "HELLOWORLD".

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           DISPLAY "FIRST 5: " FULL-STR(1:5)
           DISPLAY "LAST 5: " FULL-STR(6:5)
           DISPLAY "MIDDLE 4: " FULL-STR(4:4)
           MOVE "XY" TO FULL-STR(3:2)
           DISPLAY "AFTER PATCH: " FULL-STR
           STOP RUN.
